---
// src/pages/zh-cn/archive.astro
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>往期目录 | 推开部屋的门</title>
    <!-- 引入 Noto Serif SC 以支持簡體中文更佳的襯線顯示 -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DotGothic16&family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@400;700;900&family=Noto+Serif+TC:wght@400;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root{
            --win-gray:#c0c0c0;
            --win-dark:#808080;
            --win-light:#ffffff;
            --win-blue:#000080;
            --y2k-purple:#4B2D8C;
            --y2k-pink:#FF66B3;
            --y2k-mint:#B2F5EA;
            --text:#000000;
        }
        *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;cursor:default;}
        html,body{height:auto;min-height:100%;}
        body{
            background:linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.3) 1px,transparent 1px),
                       linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.3) 1px,transparent 1px),
                       linear-gradient(to right,#98fb98,#fffacd,#ffebcd,#ffb6c1,#e0b0ff);
            background-size:20px 20px,20px 20px,100% 100%;
            background-attachment:fixed;
            font-family:'DotGothic16','SimSun','STSong','細明體',sans-serif;
            overflow-x:hidden;overflow-y:auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;
        }
        
        .marquee-bar{background:#000;color:#0f0;padding:12px 0;min-height:60px;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden;border-bottom:3px solid var(--win-dark);z-index:2000; position:relative;}
        .marquee-content{display:flex;white-space:nowrap;font-size:1.2rem;animation:scroll 25s linear infinite;letter-spacing:2px;}
        @keyframes scroll{0%{transform:translateX(0);}100%{transform:translateX(-50%);}}

        .desktop-wrapper{display:flex;flex:1;padding:25px;gap:40px;padding-bottom:80px;min-height:1000px;position:relative;}
        .desktop-copyright { position: fixed; bottom: 60px; right: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: #555; text-shadow: 1px 1px 0px rgba(255,255,255,0.8); z-index: 10; }

        .desktop-icons{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:25px;width:100px;padding-top:10px;z-index:10;}
        .desktop-icon{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-decoration:none;padding:10px 5px;cursor:pointer;}
        .desktop-icons .icon-emoji{font-size:45px;margin-bottom:5px;filter:drop-shadow(2px 2px 0px rgba(0,0,0,1));}
        .icon-text{color:#fff;background-color:var(--win-blue);font-size:13px;text-align:center;padding:2px 6px;border:1px dotted transparent;}
        .desktop-icon:hover .icon-text { border: 1px dotted #fff; background-color: var(--y2k-purple); }
        
        .archive-folders { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px 30px; padding: 20px; align-content: flex-start; max-width: 450px;}
        .folder-btn { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; width: 90px; cursor: pointer; }
        .folder-btn .icon-emoji { font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 5px; filter: drop-shadow(1px 1px 0px rgba(0,0,0,1)); transition: transform 0.1s;}
        .folder-text { color: #000; font-family: 'DotGothic16', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; text-align: center; padding: 2px 6px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); border: 1px dashed var(--win-dark); margin-top: 5px; }
        .folder-btn:hover .icon-emoji { transform: translateY(-2px); }
        .folder-btn:hover .folder-text { background-color: var(--y2k-mint); border: 1px solid #000; box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--y2k-pink); font-weight: bold; }

        #playground{flex:1;position:relative; z-index: 50;}
        
        .window{background:var(--win-gray);border:2px solid;border-color:var(--win-light) #000 #000 var(--win-light);box-shadow:inset 1px 1px 0 #dfdfdf,inset -1px -1px 0 var(--win-dark),2px 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5);display:none;flex-direction:column;position:fixed;height:auto;padding:3px;z-index:100;}
        .window.active { display: flex; }
        .title-bar{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--win-blue),#1084d0);padding:3px 6px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;color:white;font-size:13px;cursor:move;letter-spacing:1px; user-select: none;}
        .win-controls{display:flex;gap:2px;margin-left:10px;}
        .win-btn{width:18px;height:18px;background-color:var(--win-gray);border:2px solid;border-color:var(--win-light) var(--win-dark) var(--win-dark) var(--win-light);color:#000;font-family:'Pixel',sans-serif;font-size:10px;font-weight:bold;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:1px 1px 0 #000;}
        .win-btn:active{border-color:var(--win-dark) var(--win-light) var(--win-light) var(--win-dark);padding-top:2px;padding-left:2px;box-shadow:none;}
        
        .win-content{flex:1;margin-top:4px;padding:15px;border:2px solid;border-color:var(--win-dark) var(--win-light) var(--win-light) var(--win-dark);overflow-y: auto; max-height: 480px;}
        .archive-card { background: #fff; border: 2px solid #000; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; box-shadow: 3px 3px 0px var(--win-gray); display: flex; flex-direction: column;}
        .card-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px;}
        .card-title { font-family: 'Noto Serif SC', 'Noto Serif TC', serif; font-weight: 900; color: var(--win-blue); font-size: 1.15rem; border-bottom: 3px solid var(--y2k-mint); padding-bottom: 2px; line-height: 1.3;}
        .card-tag { font-family: 'DotGothic16', sans-serif; font-size: 11px; background: #FFE4F2; color: var(--y2k-purple); padding: 3px 10px; border: 1px solid var(--y2k-purple); border-radius: 20px; font-weight: bold; box-shadow: inset -1px -1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.1), inset 1px 1px 2px #fff; letter-spacing: 0.5px;}
        .card-desc { font-family: 'Noto Serif SC', 'Noto Serif TC', serif; color: #333; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 1.6; flex: 1;}
        .card-desc strong { color: var(--y2k-purple); font-weight: 900;}
        .card-desc ul { margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 5px; color: #555; font-size: 0.9rem; }
        
        .card-actions { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 10px; margin-top: auto; border-top: 1px dashed #ccc; padding-top: 10px; }
        .btn-unlock { background: var(--y2k-pink); color: #fff; border: 2px solid #000; box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #000; padding: 4px 12px; font-size: 12px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; }
        .btn-unlock:active { transform: translate(1px,1px); box-shadow: 0px 0px 0 #000; }
        .btn-preview { background: var(--y2k-mint); color: #000; border: 2px solid #000; box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #000; padding: 4px 12px; font-size: 12px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; }
        .btn-preview:active { transform: translate(1px,1px); box-shadow: 0px 0px 0 #000; }

        /* 🔥 8 大主题专属定制 CSS 🔥 */
        #mag-win .win-content { background: repeating-linear-gradient(transparent, transparent 24px, #ccc 24px, #ccc 25px), #fefefe; }
        #mag-win .archive-card { border: 2px dashed #4169E1; box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 rgba(65, 105, 225, 0.2); }
        #mag-win .btn-unlock { background: #4169E1; }

        #bookstore-win .win-content { background-color: #FFF5E1; background-image: radial-gradient(#FFA07A 15%, transparent 15%); background-size: 15px 15px; }
        #bookstore-win .archive-card { background: #FFFAF0; border-color: #D2691E; }
        #bookstore-win .btn-unlock { background: #FF8C00; } 

        #fair-win .win-content { background: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #FFE4E1, #FFE4E1 10px, #FFF0F5 10px, #FFF0F5 20px); }
        #fair-win .archive-card { box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #FF1493; border-color: #FF1493; }
        #fair-win .btn-unlock { background: #FF1493; }

        #resource-win .win-content { background-color: #111; background-image: linear-gradient(#0f0 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, #0f0 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 20px 20px; }
        #resource-win .archive-card { background: #222; border: 2px solid #0f0; box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 #0f0; }
        #resource-win .card-title { color: #0f0; border-bottom: 2px dashed #0f0; }
        #resource-win .card-desc { color: #aaa; }
        #resource-win .card-desc strong { color: #fff; }
        #resource-win .card-tag { background: #000; color: #0f0; border: 1px solid #0f0; box-shadow: none; }
        #resource-win .card-actions { border-top: 1px dashed #444; }
        #resource-win .btn-unlock { background: #0f0; color: #000; box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #005500; }

        #music-win .win-content { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #E6E6FA, #FFF0F5, #E0FFFF); }
        #music-win .archive-card { border-radius: 10px; border-color: #9370DB; }
        #music-win .btn-unlock { background: #8A2BE2; }

        #film-win .win-content { background: #333; padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px; position: relative; }
        #film-win .win-content::before { content:''; position:absolute; top:0; bottom:0; left:2px; width:10px; background: repeating-linear-gradient(transparent, transparent 10px, #fff 10px, #fff 20px); }
        #film-win .win-content::after { content:''; position:absolute; top:0; bottom:0; right:2px; width:10px; background: repeating-linear-gradient(transparent, transparent 10px, #fff 10px, #fff 20px); }
        #film-win .archive-card { background: #FFF8DC; border-color: #000; }
        #film-win .btn-unlock { background: #B22222; }

        #doc-win .win-content { background: #DEB887; box-shadow: inset 0 0 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
        #doc-win .archive-card { background: #F5F5DC; border-style: dashed; }
        #doc-win .btn-unlock { background: #8B4513; }

        #podcast-win .win-content { background-color: #E0FFFF; background-image: repeating-radial-gradient(circle at 0 0, transparent 0, #E0FFFF 10px, #AFEEEE 10px, #AFEEEE 20px); }
        #podcast-win .btn-unlock { background: #20B2AA; }


        .taskbar{position:fixed;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;height:42px;background:var(--win-gray);border-top:2px solid var(--win-light);display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 6px;z-index:3000;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 #dfdfdf;}
        .start-btn{background:var(--win-gray);border:2px solid;border-color:var(--win-light) var(--win-dark) var(--win-dark) var(--win-light);padding:4px 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;text-decoration:none;color:#000;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;flex-shrink:0;}
        .start-btn:active{border-color:var(--win-dark) var(--win-light) var(--win-light) var(--win-dark);padding:5px 11px 3px 13px;}
        .taskbar-windows{display:flex;gap:5px;margin-left:10px;flex:1;overflow-x:auto;}
        .taskbar-win-tab{background:var(--win-gray);border:2px solid;border-color:var(--win-light) var(--win-dark) var(--win-dark) var(--win-light);padding:4px 12px;font-size:13px;color:#000;display:none;align-items:center;gap:6px;cursor:pointer;max-width:150px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap; user-select: none;}
        .taskbar-win-tab.visible { display: flex; }
        .taskbar-win-tab.active{border-color:var(--win-dark) var(--win-light) var(--win-light) var(--win-dark);background:#d0d0d0;font-weight:bold;background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,transparent,transparent 2px,#c0c0c0 2px,#c0c0c0 4px);}
        .subscribe-pill{background:var(--y2k-pink);color:white;padding:4px 15px;text-decoration:none;border:2px solid #000;box-shadow:2px 2px 0 #000;flex-shrink:0;font-size:13px;}
        .system-tray{margin-left:10px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-shrink:0;border:2px solid;border-color:var(--win-dark) var(--win-light) var(--win-light) var(--win-dark);padding:2px 10px;height:32px;}
        .social-link{color:#000;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;}
        .social-link:hover{color:var(--win-blue);text-decoration:underline;}
        .lang-switch{display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;border-left:1px solid var(--win-dark);border-right:1px solid var(--win-light);padding:0 10px;font-size:13px;}
        .lang-link{color:var(--win-dark);text-decoration:none;}
        .lang-link.active{color:#000;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;}
        .clock{font-size:13px;color:#000;}

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .desktop-wrapper { flex-direction: column; padding: 15px; padding-bottom: 70px; min-height: auto; }
            .desktop-icons { flex-direction: row; flex-wrap: wrap; width: 100%; justify-content: center; gap: 15px; padding-bottom: 20px; }
            .desktop-icon { width: 80px; padding: 5px; }
            .archive-folders { justify-content: center; padding: 10px; gap: 15px; max-width: 100%;}
            .window { position: fixed !important; width: 90vw !important; left: 5vw !important; top: 10vh !important; }
            .taskbar { padding: 0 6px; overflow-x: auto; white-space: nowrap; gap: 8px; justify-content: flex-start; height: 48px; }
            .taskbar::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
            .taskbar-windows { display: none; }
            .subscribe-pill { margin-left: 0; }
            .system-tray { margin-left: 0; }
            .desktop-copyright { position: static; text-align: center; margin: 20px 0; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="marquee-bar">
        <div class="marquee-content">
            >> SYSTEM.MSG: [ <span style="color:var(--y2k-pink);">第四季早鳥活動</span> ] 進行中_ // ENDS_ON: <span style="color:var(--y2k-mint);">2026.05.17</span> // [ <span style="color:var(--y2k-pink);">全新主題策展正刊 ＋ 雜誌通信副刊</span> ] // 在邊緣捕捉與想像 ✴ &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
            >> SYSTEM.MSG: [ <span style="color:var(--y2k-pink);">第四季早鳥活動</span> ] 進行中_ // ENDS_ON: <span style="color:var(--y2k-mint);">2026.05.17</span> // [ <span style="color:var(--y2k-pink);">全新主題策展正刊 ＋ 雜誌通信副刊</span> ] // 在邊緣捕捉與想像 ✴ &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="desktop-wrapper">
        <div class="desktop-icons">
            <a href="/" class="desktop-icon"><span class="icon-emoji">🏠</span><span class="icon-text">主页</span></a>
            <a href="/zh-cn/about" class="desktop-icon"><span class="icon-emoji">🐘</span><span class="icon-text">关于小象</span></a>
            <a href="/zh-cn/archive" class="desktop-icon"><span class="icon-emoji">📂</span><span class="icon-text">往期目录</span></a>
            <a href="/zh-cn/guestbook" class="desktop-icon"><span class="icon-emoji">💬</span><span class="icon-text">留言板</span></a>
        </div>

        <div class="archive-folders">
            <div class="folder-btn" onclick="bringToFront('mag-win')"><span class="icon-emoji">📖</span><span class="folder-text">纸本通信</span></div>
            <div class="folder-btn" onclick="bringToFront('bookstore-win')"><span class="icon-emoji">🏡</span><span class="folder-text">书店现场</span></div>
            <div class="folder-btn" onclick="bringToFront('fair-win')"><span class="icon-emoji">🎪</span><span class="folder-text">展场漫游</span></div>
            <div class="folder-btn" onclick="bringToFront('resource-win')"><span class="icon-emoji">🎒</span><span class="folder-text">数字生存</span></div>
            <div class="folder-btn" onclick="bringToFront('music-win')"><span class="icon-emoji">🎧</span><span class="folder-text">听觉切片</span></div>
            <div class="folder-btn" onclick="bringToFront('film-win')"><span class="icon-emoji">🎞️</span><span class="folder-text">光影放映</span></div>
            <div class="folder-btn" onclick="bringToFront('doc-win')"><span class="icon-emoji">📽️</span><span class="folder-text">真实定格</span></div>
            <div class="folder-btn" onclick="bringToFront('podcast-win')"><span class="icon-emoji">📻</span><span class="folder-text">声音频率</span></div>
        </div>

        <div id="playground">
            
            <div id="mag-win" class="window draggable" style="width: 480px; left: 15vw; top: 10vh;">
                <div class="title-bar"><span>📖 Zines_Comm.doc</span><div class="win-btn" onclick="closeWin('mag-win')">×</div></div>
                <div class="win-content">
                    <div class="archive-card">
                        <div class="card-header">
                            <span class="card-title">Issue#01 我们的飞地</span>
                            <span class="card-tag">LITERATURE</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-desc">
                            从文学期刊出发，探讨 <strong>《联合文学》</strong> 與 <strong>《新活水》</strong>，并附港台期刊、博硕士论文查阅方式。
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-actions">
                            <a href="https://elephlow1217.notion.site/Issue-01-1-35115431c08d8120ba20f72b2be8571d?source=copy_link" target="_blank" class="btn-preview">✨ 免费试阅</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="archive-card">
                        <div class="card-header">
                            <span class="card-title">Issue#15 与异见共存</span>
                            <span class="card-tag">MAGAZINE</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-desc">
                            关注对岸非营利组织机构，并翻阅 <strong>《薰风》</strong> 杂志。
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-actions">
                            <a href="https://elephlow1217.notion.site/Issue-15-35115431c08d81c9ba18f44e4a6a26c9?source=copy_link" target="_blank" class="btn-preview">✨ 免费试阅</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="archive-card">
                        <div class="card-header">
                            <span class="card-title">阅读小报 002：正发生</span>
                            <span class="card-tag">ZINE & PUB</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-desc">
                            图解酷儿史、Garo漫画大革命，以及 <strong>VOP 摄影之声</strong> 等出版物梳理。
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-actions">
                            <a href="https://elephlow1217.notion.site/002-35415431c08d80f8888dd173b80840a3?source=copy_link" target="_blank" class="btn-preview">✨ 免费试阅</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="archive-card">
                        <div class="card-header">
                            <span class="card-title">Issue#18 甜美生活</span>
                            <span class="card-tag">EARLY PUB</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-desc">
                            翻阅早期台湾流行文化杂志，深度探索 <strong>《汉声》杂志</strong>，以及早期的出版生态。
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-actions">
                            <a href="https://tally.so/r/4415XB" target="_blank" class="btn-unlock">🔒 解锁本期</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="archive-card">
                        <div class="card-header">
                            <span class="card-title">Issue#19 沉默之声</span>
                            <span class="card-tag">PUBLISHING</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-desc">
                            逃离与失声：探讨 <strong>《皇冠》杂志</strong> 历史与其背后的出版帝国。
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-actions">
                            <a href="https://tally.so/r/4415XB" target="_blank" class="btn-unlock">🔒 解锁本期</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div id="bookstore-win" class="window draggable" style="width: 480px; left: 20vw; top: 15vh;">
                <div class="title-bar"><span>🏡 Bookstores_Live.exe</span><div class="win-btn" onclick="closeWin('bookstore-win')">×</div></div>
                <div class="win-content">
                    <div class="archive-card">
                        <div class="card-header">
                            <span class="card-title">Issue#13 永远困惑，永远好奇。</span>
                            <span class="card-tag">TAIPEI</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-desc">
                            游书店 001：走入充满设计与独立出版生命力的 <strong>田园城市风格书店</strong>。
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-actions">
                            <a href="https://tally.so/r/4415XB" target="_blank" class="btn-unlock">🔒 解锁本期</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="archive-card">
                        <div class="card-header">
                            <span class="card-title">Issue#14 随波逐流</span>
                            <span class="card-tag">TAIPEI</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-desc">
                            游书店 002：走进台湾历史悠久的外文书店 <strong>书林书店</strong>。
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-actions">
                            <a href="https://tally.so/r/4415XB" target="_blank" class="btn-unlock">🔒 解锁本期</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="archive-card">
                        <div class="card-header">
                            <span class="card-title">Issue#24 越洋电话</span>
                            <span class="card-tag">SEOUL</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-desc">
                            游书店 009：韩国首尔 <strong>今日书房（책방오늘）</strong>，并开箱来自韩国的独立出版品。
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-actions">
                            <a href="https://tally.so/r/4415XB" target="_blank" class="btn-unlock">🔒 解锁本期</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="archive-card">
                        <div class="card-header">
                            <span class="card-title">Issue#28 落脚点</span>
                            <span class="card-tag">HONG KONG</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-desc">
                            香港独立书店巡礼，特别推荐 <strong>Zine Coop</strong> 及超齐全的台港海外独立书店名单。
                        </div>
